C Recovered from PERSO 2113/1160; labels and comments are new.
 PASCODER:,NAME,
 MACROBSS:,SUBP,
 P/BOOT:,SUBP,
 P/CODER:,SUBP,
 PROGRAM:,SUBP,
C 000-002: M8=self, M9=descriptor. Save optional third TABLE word.
