 9,VTM,P/CODER
 ,NTR,3B
 9,XTA,2B
 8,ATX,60B
 9,XTA,
C 003-005: reject non-octal digits in the six-digit W and two-digit L.
 8,AAX,44B
 ,U1A,BADW
 9,XTA,1B
 8,AAX,46B
 ,U1A,BADL
 9,XTA,
C 006-012: pack W; memory page comes from the location of P/CODER.
 8,APX,45B
