 9,XTA,1B
C 013-021: pack L; copy cell 017; derive required pages from FREE.
 8,APX,47B
 ,ASN,152B
 ,XTS,17B
 9,ATX,1B
 8,AAX,52B
 8,A-X,51B
 8,ATX,61B
 ,ASN,112B
 8,A-X,57B
 8,ARX,51B
 9,ATX,2B
 ,ATI,1B
 15,X-A,
 ,U1A,SMALL
C 022-024: optional third word replaces only the saved stack word.
C Its five octal digits occupy TEXT character positions 3 through 7.
 8,XTA,60B
 ,UZA,WRITE
 8,APX,50B
 ,ASN,141B
 9,ATX,1B
 ,UTC,
C 025-030: write successive memory pages to successive disk zones.
 WRITE:9,*70,
 ,UTC,
 9,XTA,
 8,ARX,55B
 9,ATX,
 1,UTM,77777B
 1,V1M,WRITE
 8,A-X,51B
C 031-040: format the zone/word range, print it, end the build job.
 ,ASN,42B
 8,AUX,53B
 8,ATX,72B
 8,XTA,56B
 8,AUX,53B
 8,ATX,70B
 8,XTA,61B
 ,ASN,32B
